<p>最近Mac Mini M4(<em>下文简称&quot;Mini&quot;</em>)很火,但是苹果的内存向来是金子做的,大存储配置特别贵. 不少朋友买Mini都是本着性价比去的. 我借着裸辞在家没事干,折腾了一周,给大家分享我的方案.</p>]]></description></item><item><title>深度生产力指南：我的macOS软件栈与系统调优全解析</title><link>https://iyhome.github.io/macos-apps/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Mar 2025 22:52:18 +0800</pubDate><author>Serein</author><guid>https://iyhome.github.io/macos-apps/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h4 id="homebrew"><a href="https://brew.sh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">HomeBrew</a></h4>
<blockquote>
<p>macOS的包管理器，类似Ubuntu的apt、Arch的pacman、Redhat的yum</p></blockquote>
<p><strong>安装</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>采用<a href="https://mirrors.ustc.edu.cn/help/brew.git.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">中科大源</a></p></blockquote>
<ul>
<li>首先在命令行运行如下几条命令设置环境变量：</li>
</ul>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">export</span> <span class="nv">HOMEBREW_BREW_GIT_REMOTE</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34;https://mirrors.ustc.edu.cn/brew.git&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">export</span> <span class="nv">HOMEBREW_CORE_GIT_REMOTE</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34;https://mirrors.ustc.edu.cn/homebrew-core.git&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">export</span> <span class="nv">HOMEBREW_BOTTLE_DOMAIN</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34;https://mirrors.ustc.edu.cn/homebrew-bottles&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">export</span> <span class="nv">HOMEBREW_API_DOMAIN</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34;https://mirrors.ustc.edu.cn/homebrew-bottles/api&#34;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><ul>
<li>之后在命令行运行 Homebrew 安装脚本：</li>
</ul>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">/bin/bash -c <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="k">$(</span>curl -fsSL https://github.com/Homebrew/install/raw/HEAD/install.sh<span class="k">)</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><blockquote>
<p>⭐️初次安装 Homebrew / Linuxbrew 时，如果无法下载安装脚本， 可以使用我们每日同步的安装脚本文件。</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>